    "updated_at": "2022-02-28T11:01:41Z",
    "body": "I think overall this sounds reasonable. I think the tricky bit is figuring out the policy container to be used for any fetches resulting from the 103. How will we deal with CSP, referrer, sandboxing, etc.\r\n\r\nAnother challenge here is that currently Fetch is handed a \"client\" which doesn't really work for this. (Arguably that setup needs some changes anyway as Fetch needs to pull of what it needs before it goes in parallel and I'm not sure it does for everything.)",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
