    "created_at": "2022-03-02T06:49:13Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-03-02T06:49:13Z",
    "body": "> Another challenge here is that currently Fetch is handed a \"client\" which doesn't really work for this. (Arguably that setup needs some changes anyway as Fetch needs to pull of what it needs before it goes in parallel and I'm not sure it does for everything.)\r\n\r\nI think our friends here are [creating a policy container from a fetch response](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#creating-a-policy-container-from-a-fetch-response) and [reserved client](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-request-reserved-client). We might not need a fake document if we piggy back on those.\r\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
